			"notes": "PermaClicker 1.4.0 adds a new Mobs & Animals click mode for AFK mob and animal farms. Instead of holding attack to mine, it hits whatever mob or animal is in your crosshair as soon as your attack cooldown is fully charged, so every hit lands at full strength. It never attacks players, and you can switch modes in the config screen.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hrobasti/permaclicker-mod/compare/1.3.0...1.4.0"
